{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261018/photo/bkn-20261018152742447-1018_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261018164735\"/><p>景榮樓有兩名長者懷疑燒炭輕生。(陳嘉傑攝)</p><p>今日(18日)下午2時39分，執法部門接獲報案，屯門山景邨景榮樓一單位內，兩名年約70歲的男女懷疑燒炭輕生。救援人員奉召到場，發現兩人昏迷倒臥屋內，立即將他們送往屯門醫院搶救。執法部門正調查事件。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T08:58:31.519223+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:27:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T09:37:41.667411+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T08:57:35.167747+00:00","content_hash":"df9f413a285a898938e609eadad42a661606f1d00c1e87ddf78bd33905ecc4d3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}